    {
      "id": 66926,
      "name": "Craig",
      "username": "Craig",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-07-19T17:05:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'll be honest. Yes, it's super cool that people are rating it well. But I don't pay a lick of attention to the BGG rankings. I own many, many games that I love and get lots of play, and most of them aren't in the top 200. Most of the games ranked in the top 100 have failed to interest me. I've long since come to terms with the fact that the games on BGG are rated by people with different tastes than myself.</p><p>That being said, SotM (and the expansions) is my only 10.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:44:46.475Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
