      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I&#39;ll be honest. Yes, it&#39;s super cool that people are rating it well. But I don&#39;t pay a lick of attention to the BGG rankings. I own many, many games that I love and get lots of play, and most of them aren&#39;t in the top 200. Most of the games ranked in the top 100 have failed to interest me. I&#39;ve long since come to terms with the fact that the games on BGG are rated by people with different tastes than myself.</p><p>That being said, SotM (and the expansions) is my only 10.</p>",
